[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7860.31, "timestamp": "02:11:00", "text": "该死。呃，电脑要关机了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7862.629, "timestamp": "02:11:02", "text": "向下和东西。我看了一眼，发现它甚至都不在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7866.47, "timestamp": "02:11:06", "text": "打开东西。呃，我确实注意到了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7868.39, "timestamp": "02:11:08", "text": "几天前。我当时想，也许是这样吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7870.87, "timestamp": "02:11:10", "text": "只是显卡的问题，我以前……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7873.189, "timestamp": "02:11:13", "text": "重置内存和其他所有设置。我做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7876.149, "timestamp": "02:11:16", "text": "我能做的都做了。所以显然是CPU"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7877.47, "timestamp": "02:11:17", "text": "内部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7881.79, "timestamp": "02:11:21", "text": "死了。哦，对了，是 Ryzen 7。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7886.47, "timestamp": "02:11:26", "text": "3800X，用了大概6年后就坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7888.709, "timestamp": "02:11:28", "text": "呃，正在工作。它当时靠呼吸机维持生命。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7891.83, "timestamp": "02:11:31", "text": "我甚至不知道它当时靠生命维持系统维持生命。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.47, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "等等，他靠生命维持系统是怎么活下来的？喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7897.47, "timestamp": "02:11:37", "text": "已经过去六年了。所以我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7902.069, "timestamp": "02:11:42", "text": "它活了6年后就死了。通常情况下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7905.91, "timestamp": "02:11:45", "text": "CPU，即处理器，其使用寿命可能为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7908.27, "timestamp": "02:11:48", "text": "12年，对吧？或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7916.95, "timestamp": "02:11:56", "text": "当然。但是，嗯，至于画面方面……"}]